{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/42982-creating-cults-with-access-to-sorcery","id":42982,"title":"Creating Cults with access to Sorcery","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mummy: The Curse"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-05T10:29:28-08:00","id":42982,"title":"Creating Cults with access to Sorcery","content":"Well the easy solution is to have your Cult start with Sorcery, as anything could have happened in the past, whether they reclaimed Sorcery Merits from Lost Irem, or developed them over the Sothic Turns. But say you have to start a Cult from Scratch, though possibly with other Mummies, how would you cultivate Magical powers within the cult? There are a number of ways I could see this going.<br /> <br /> The big sources I would use to represent this would be Second Sight, the God Machine Rules Update, and Pendragon's Thaumaturgy <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/11HySDVBaLtKQgEVMOX3SHVBJmEk4XmRqPntwMctxbuo/edit#\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...wMctxbuo/edit#</a>, though I think things like Cultivating Proximi <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/11Urxj0z6zvILm6-RAdUWXi5X_M6ppIjQ54H2Cb_prQM/edit\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...H2Cb_prQM/edit</a>, or Hedge Sorcery <a href=\"http://www.podbean.com/site/UserDownload/index/bid/286887/url/http%253A%252F%252Fdarkerdays2.podbean.com%252Fmf%252Fweb%252Fwgpe57%252FFL4.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.podbean.com/site/UserDown...57%252FFL4.pdf</a> <br /> or even actual Mage Bloodlines would be cool.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-05T12:55:32-08:00","id":43072,"title":"","content":"Ah Wyrd Sorcery, that brings back very fond memories <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Hunter is probably the best source to go to for how a group of mortals gets a shared magical trick. Usually when it's actually explained how this group got it's tricks they tend to go back to one individual creating a monumental discovery (Ascending Ones, Promethian Brotherhood and VASCU both make this explicit).<br /> <br /> My suggestion therefore would be to think about a cool quest for the mystic McGuffin; find it and that gives your cult magic. It can grow out from there with more spells or what have you. The McGuffin could be anything from a book of spells, to a crystallised Utterance that might be reverse engineered, to test subjects for a brilliant scientist.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],